{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Керимче калыр чоң жагынан,", "text": "Керимче калыр чоң жагынан,", "en": "From the great branch that would remain with Kerimche,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening proper name and the verb are difficult; provisionally read Керимче калыр.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Укум калба деп уктум,", "text": "Укум калба деп уктум,", "en": "I heard that no offspring remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is written Укум, likely a reduced spelling of тукум; the polarity of калба is retained.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Төрү түрлүү калктардын,", "text": "Төрү түрлүү калктардын,", "en": "Among peoples of many different ranks,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening word is provisionally read Төрү.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Аты Кенен туулуп,", "text": "Аты Кенен туулуп,", "en": "One named Kenen was born,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Тукум калды деп уктум.", "text": "Тукум калды деп уктум.", "en": "I heard that a descendant remained.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Мекен кылып Ала-Тоо,", "text": "Мекен кылып Ала-Тоо,", "en": "Making Ala-Too his homeland,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Коңур калды деп уктум,", "text": "Коңур калды деп уктум,", "en": "I heard that Kongur remained,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Коңур may be a personal name or an abbreviated reference to Kongurbay.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Каракуманга барганда,", "text": "Каракуманга барганда,", "en": "When he went to Karakuman,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The place name is provisionally read Каракуман.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Калтай жагынан салганда,", "text": "Калтай жагынан салганда,", "en": "When Kaltai attacked from his side,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Калтай is treated as a proper name; the idiom жагынан салганда is translated contextually.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Качып канын соо кылып,", "text": "Качып канын соо кылып,", "en": "Fleeing, he saved the khan alive,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word and the phrase соо кылып are visually plausible; the object may instead be канын “his blood.”", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Калтайга доо кылып,", "text": "Калтайга доо кылып,", "en": "Laying a claim against Kaltai,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name and idiomatic force of доо кылып remain provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Канын алды деп уктум.", "text": "Канын алды деп уктум.", "en": "I heard that he took his blood in vengeance.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Канын алды is clear enough visually but may mean either killed him or avenged blood.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Оң жагынан үч жүрүп,", "text": "Оң жагынан үч жүрүп,", "en": "Advancing three times from the right flank,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The numeral and final participle are difficult; read provisionally as үч жүрүп.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Опсуз жаңжал кылды дейт,", "text": "Опсуз жаңжал кылды дейт,", "en": "They say he waged a boundless battle,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is provisionally read Опсуз.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Маңдай-тескей турушуп,", "text": "Маңдай-тескей турушуп,", "en": "Standing face to face,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Мылтык атып, жаа тартып,", "text": "Мылтык атып, жаа тартып,", "en": "Firing muskets and drawing bows,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Былчылдашып урушуп,", "text": "Былчылдашып урушуп,", "en": "They fought in a bloody clash,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Жазайыл чоң, жаа атып,", "text": "Жазайыл чоң, жаа атып,", "en": "Firing the great jazayil and the bow,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript appears to read Жазайыл чоң; punctuation and syntax are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Жаман кыргыз салды дейт.", "text": "Жаман кыргыз салды дейт.", "en": "They say the wretched Kyrgyz attacked.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle ethnonym is read кыргыз, though the handwriting is compressed.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Өрөткүл келип оро жүрүп,", "text": "Өрөткүл келип оро жүрүп,", "en": "The Örötkül came and moved around them,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Өрөткүл is treated as a group or proper name; the last phrase is difficult.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Жазасыз жүргөн кытайын,", "text": "Жазасыз жүргөн кытайын,", "en": "The Chinese who went unpunished,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is provisionally read Жазасыз.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Буйткада жайлап чаптырып,", "text": "Буйткада жайлап чаптырып,", "en": "Ambushing them in a hidden place and striking them down,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Буйткада and the martial sense of жайлап чаптырып are contextual readings.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Өз дүйнөсүн чачтырып,", "text": "Өз дүйнөсүн чачтырып,", "en": "Scattering all their possessions,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Өрөткүл кайра кайтыптыр.", "text": "Өрөткүл кайра кайтыптыр.", "en": "The Örötkül then turned back.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The group or proper name is provisionally read Өрөткүл.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Ал журттун мизин кайтарып,", "text": "Ал журттун мизин кайтарып,", "en": "Turning back the edge of that host,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Баатыры Бадыкан,", "text": "Баатыры Бадыкан,", "en": "Their hero was Badykan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name is provisionally read Бадыкан.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Бадырайган ал кытай,", "text": "Бадырайган ал кытай,", "en": "That glaring Chinese warrior,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is read кытай; the short line may be syntactically attached to its neighbors.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Кайра айтар жан калбай,", "text": "Кайра айтар жан калбай,", "en": "With no soul left to answer back,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Кара жолтой ал бүркүт,", "text": "Кара жолтой ал бүркүт,", "en": "That ill-fated eagle,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The epithet is provisionally read Кара жолтой.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Кырган сындай түшүрүп,", "text": "Кырган сындай түшүрүп,", "en": "Casting them down as though slaughtered,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The phrase is provisionally read Кырган сындай.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Киши бетин каралбай,", "text": "Киши бетин каралбай,", "en": "Without looking any man in the face,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final form is manuscript-like каралбай, whose syntax is irregular.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Башы кара, буту айры,", "text": "Башы кара, буту айры,", "en": "Black-headed and fork-footed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Адам жоон бөзгө албай,", "text": "Адам жоон бөзгө албай,", "en": "Unable to reckon a man worth even coarse cloth,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is difficult; жоон бөзгө is visually likely and the English is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Каттаганды байлатып,", "text": "Каттаганды байлатып,", "en": "Having every passerby bound,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is provisionally read Каттаганды.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf033:l035", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 33, "folio": 416, "line_in_page": 35, "raw": "Кабылан канын түшүрүп.", "text": "Кабылан канын түшүрүп.", "en": "Bringing down the leopard-like khan.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript seems to read кабылан канын; the syntax may instead refer to “leopard blood.”", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf034:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 34, "folio": 417, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Каршы барган адамдан,", "text": "Каршы барган адамдан,", "en": "From the man who went to meet them,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is read Каршы; the clause continues from the preceding folio.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf034:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 34, "folio": 417, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Кабаргасын соолуттур.", "text": "Кабаргасын соолуттур.", "en": "He has wrung the news from him.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The joined manuscript reading Кабаргасын соолуттур and its translation are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf034:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 34, "folio": 417, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Баатырдыгын, шаазылыгын,", "text": "Баатырдыгын, шаазылыгын,", "en": "His heroism and princely bearing,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second noun is read шаазылыгын; spelling and nuance are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf034:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 34, "folio": 417, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Баарынан мыкты эр экен,", "text": "Баарынан мыкты эр экен,", "en": "He is a warrior better than them all,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
